  "body": "The sea view stops you in your tracks. The warm, natural tones make you want to stay. Set in sought-after Ara Hills, 2 Akau Lane makes an entrance with a floating staircase and sculptural timber chandelier. Layered lighting throughout the home brings out the architectural details and gives the interiors a warm glow after dark. Head upstairs to the main lounge and you'll see why a quick morning coffee could easily turn into an hour.\r\n\r\nA gently rising hillside behind the home and expansive sea views ahead give this property a special setting. In Feng Shui, the hillside symbolises support and stability, while the open outlook towards the sea is associated with opportunity and prosperity.\r\n\r\nDownstairs is where everyone comes together. Throw open both sets of bi-folds and the designer kitchen and fully equipped butler's kitchen open onto the same covered deck. Think drinks at the island, dinner outside looking towards the council park, and all the prep tucked away in the butler's kitchen. The main kitchen features Fisher & Paykel appliances, a dedicated coffee station and a bar fridge, while the butler's kitchen has its own gas cooktop and plenty of storage.\r\n\r\nAll four double bedrooms have their own ensuite with underfloor heating, and each bedroom has individual temperature control. Three enjoy sea views, and one opens onto its own balcony. With four living areas, there's room for a movie in the upstairs media lounge while friends linger over dinner downstairs.\r\n\r\nWhat you'll love\r\n\r\n- Unobstructed sea views from the upstairs main lounge, with sea views from three bedrooms\r\n- Master Build 10-Year Guarantee, subject to the guarantee terms and transfer requirements\r\n- Four double bedrooms with individual temperature control, underfloor heating in all four ensuites and a private balcony off one bedroom\r\n- Four living areas, including an upstairs media lounge with a dedicated equipment cupboard\r\n- Two kitchens with bi-fold doors opening onto the covered entertaining deck, with an outlook towards the council park\r\n- Fisher & Paykel appliances, including an eye-level oven and microwave, integrated fridge, freezer and dishwasher, and an induction cooktop with a built-in extractor\r\n- Dedicated coffee station, bar fridge and generous kitchen cabinetry\r\n- Fully equipped butler's kitchen with a gas cooktop and generous storage\r\n- Floating staircase, sculptural timber chandelier and layered lighting throughout, plus built-in seating and storage in the entrance\r\n- Platinum Collection tapware in the kitchens and bathrooms, plus multifunction extractor fans in the ensuites\r\n- Two air-conditioning systems, a double garage, an exterior security camera and an internal alarm\r\n\r\nCome see us at 2 Akau Lane. We'll meet you in the lounge.",
